      "rationale": "The React adapter of phase 2, as the plan describes. It sees through memo, forwardRef and lazy (bare or React.*), claims PascalCase functions that return JSX or are wrapped as components and use* functions as hooks, and gives components their props, destructured defaults and forwarded ref as an interface. A JSX tag records a renders edge. On taxonomy it found 169 components, 3 hooks and 108 renders edges. Class components and context edges are not covered yet.",
